cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Antibody Reactor in evaluation or research, cite this software and the OASB dataset separately."
title: "SHPBL Antibody Reactor"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
authors:
  - family-names: Sweet
    given-names: Kenneth E.
    name-suffix: Jr.
    affiliation: SHPBL / CMPSBL
license: other
abstract: >-
  An evolutionary agent-defense laboratory that breeds weighted security-policy
  strains under external benchmark pressure, rehearses mutations, preserves
  extinct defenses as a fossil record, and promotes a surviving descendant into
  a portable vaccine artifact with a hash-chained evidence ledger.
keywords:
  - agent security
  - evolutionary defense
  - OASB
  - security benchmark
  - provenance
